   "note": [
    "ungated-dependency: DCF 2.11(b) asks about a librarian. No gate sits above it. A school can therefore report a librarian and no library. 5,845 schools do. 4,633 of them report no library, no book bank and no reading corner. A further 9,596 report an ICT lab with zero computers."
