   "definition": "Management Code of School",
   "dct:provenance": "read off the form \u2014 a person opened the Data Capture Format for this column and this year",
   "references": "DCF item 1.12(b)",
   "scopeNote": "1-Dept of Education, 2-Tribal Welfare, 3-Local Body, 4-Govt Aided, 5-Private Unaided (Recognised), 6-Other State Govt, 7-Partially Govt Aided, 8-Unrecognized, 89-Minority Affairs, 90-Social Welfare, 91-Ministry of Labour, 92-KVS, 93-NVS, 94-Sainik, 95-Railway, 96-Central Tibetan, 97-Madrasa Pvt Unaided, 98-Madarsa Unrecognized, 99-Madrasa Aided, 101-Other Central Govt/PSU, 102-Veda School",
   "note": [
    "meaning-change: Management code 7 reads 'Minority Affairs Dept.' in DCF 2021-22. It reads 'Partially Govt. Aided' in DCF 2025-26. Minority Affairs moves to code 89.",
    "unmapped-codes: DCF 2021-22 item 1.15(a) prints code 8 as Unrecognized and code 98 as Madarsa Unrecognized. The 2025-26 form drops both from its printed list. 21,330 schools still report them."
